    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Copies the APK files of apps already installed on this phone, so they can be studied (by you, or by Ophelia with `ophelia apk import`).\n\nApps installed as one APK are saved as .apk. Apps installed in pieces (split APKs) are saved as an .apks bundle: a zip of base.apk, the splits and info.json. Install it again with SAI, or unzip and use adb install-multiple.\n\nTap an app for details, long-press to select several.\n\nOnly keep what you extract for yourself: studying an app is one thing, redistributing it is another.</string>
